d score on the replay. These reference scores are in-sample."],"graph":["Adapted · one-hop attribution","For each active transcoder feature, activation × decoder direction projected onto the local gradient of the final margin. A first-order output attribution at one position."],"geometry":["Measured","Cosine similarity to each reference class centroid, in native activation coordinates."]}}